F2-0002@v1#21a5f47b Hand-over rule. When a donor hands items to a clerk, the donor pays 8 credits per item and the clerk pays 3 credits per item. The clerk does not pay the donor's share.
F2-0012@v1#a0a7d2a5 Hand-over rule. When a tanner hands items to a loader, the tanner pays 4 credits per item and the loader pays 6 credits per item. The loader does not pay the tanner's share.
